{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Preserve the existing plugin dispatch-order contract.** `PluginRunner` previously documented that every event hook runs in registration order, so reversing only `onInvocationEnd` silently changes observable behavior for existing multi-plugin configurations in a patch release. Keep legacy end-hook ordering, or introduce a versioned/opt-in scope lifecycle whose cleanup callbacks explicitly unwind in reverse.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc77JRCH","finding_digest":"228b02e451d041f1350baeb06c1087e868a78673c95bfbe462221502988bf67c","finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","line":112,"observation_digest":"176b95360f43fc7e07ebf867124a568be9fa2c4f316357e7e752e2260d7a1198","observation_id":"aro_v1_c5vzknqpip6h4b7l7btresswrp","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-08T00:48:57Z","review_id":"arr_v1_ypy2y57vtva3tue6ol67lga5xg","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"2cc073779905eb2b61db09fe0e50e867759edd7a","reviewer":"codex","start_line":109,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_ynkylbhxbsh5qic32anrusj2hy","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-08T00:48:57Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
